---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import ReturnsHero from "../../components/Returns/ReturnsHero.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Returns Policy"
  description="Our hassle-free returns and exchange policy at Mahakali Home Furnitures."
  path="/returns"
>
  <main class="returns-page">
    <ReturnsHero
      title="Returns Policy"
      subtitle="We want you to love your furniture. Here is everything you need to know about our return and exchange process."
    />

    <section class="policy-prose wrap">
      <h2>Our returns policy</h2>
      <ol class="returns-list">
        <li>Furniture, sofas, and custom curtains are non-returnable once delivered, except in cases of manufacturing defects or damage during transport.</li>
        <li>Customers must report any defect or issue within 48 hours of delivery, along with clear image/video proof.</li>
        <li>Eligible returns will be picked up and inspected by our support team before approval.</li>
        <li>Refunds (if applicable) will be processed within 7-14 working days after inspection and approval.</li>
        <li>Slight differences in color, polish shade, stitching, or texture are normal variations and not considered defects.</li>
        <li>Products damaged due to mishandling, water exposure, rough usage, or unauthorized alterations after delivery will not be eligible for return or refund.</li>
        <li>Minor variations in natural materials or screen display differences are not considered defects.</li>
        <li>Normal wear and tear after delivery — scratches, wrinkles, cushion softening — is not a valid reason for return.</li>
        <li>Refunds for online payments will be issued to the original method. COD refunds will be processed to the customer's bank account.</li>
        <li>If the customer refuses delivery without a valid reason, delivery and handling charges will be deducted from the refund.</li>
        <li>Incorrect product selection (wrong size, color, material) is not eligible for return.</li>
        <li>Products requiring assembly must be assembled only by authorized technicians. Self-installation damage voids return eligibility.</li>
        <li>Replacement depends on stock availability. If unavailable, alternatives or refunds will be offered.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
